{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"SalesQuote\">Sales Quote</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Lines\">Lines</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code From FromDate Is Item Line Lines Port Quote Quotes Sales SalesQuote SalesQuotes\">The <code>Sales Quote Lines</code> report displays all line items from your sales quotes in a detailed list format.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Is Item Port Price Quote Quotes Sales To ToDate Total\">This report helps you analyze quoted items, quantities, prices, and totals across all quotes to track sales opportunities and pricing patterns.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"IssueDate\">Issue date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"IssueDate\">Issue date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Date Is Quote Sales SalesQuote To ToDate\">The date when the sales quote was issued to the customer.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Date From FromDate Is On Price Quote Quotes SetPeriod To ToDate Update\">Use this date to track quote validity periods and monitor conversion times from quote to order. Most quotes expire after a set period and may require price updates.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reference\">Reference</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reference\">Reference</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is Quote Reference Sales SalesQuote\">The unique reference number for this sales quote.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Code Custom Customer Is On Orders Quote Quotes Reference Sent To ToDate\">Use a consistent numbering system like <code>QUO — 2024 — 001</code> to track quotes easily. Reference numbers are essential for customer communications and converting quotes to orders.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Is Quote To ToDate\">The customer or prospect receiving this quote.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Create Custom Customer History Is Quote Select To ToDate\">Select the correct customer to apply their specific pricing and terms. For new prospects, create a customer record first to maintain a complete quote history.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is Quote Summary\">A summary of what this quote covers.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code Custom Customer Customers Description Is Name Off On Project Quote Sent To ToDate\">Include project names or service descriptions like <code>Annual maintenance contract</code> or <code>Office renovation  —  Phase 1</code>. This description appears on the quote document sent to customers.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Item\">Item</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Item\">Item</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is Line On Quote\">The product or service being quoted on this line.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Automatic Code Custom Description From FromDate InventoryItem InventoryItems Is Item Line LineDescription On Price Select Tax TaxCode To ToDate\">Select from your <code>Inventory Items</code> or <code>Non — inventory Items</code> list. Choosing an item automatically fills in its description, price, and tax code. For custom items, leave this blank and use the line description field.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"LineDescription\">Line description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"LineDescription\">Line description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Description Is Item Line On\">A detailed description for this line item.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Custom Customer Customers Description Exactly On Quote To ToDate\">Include model numbers, specifications, or service details. Clear descriptions help customers understand exactly what they are being quoted and reduce follow-up questions.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Qty\">Qty</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Qty\">Qty</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Quote\">The quantity of units being quoted.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Is Item Line On Price Settings To ToDate Total UnitPrice\">Enter the quantity based on customer requirements. This multiplies with the unit price to calculate the line total. Ensure the unit of measure matches your item settings.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"UnitPrice\">Unit price</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"UnitPrice\">Unit price</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is Item Price\">The price per unit for this item.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Count Custom Customer Customers Discount Is Item On Price Quote Quotes Rate Rent To ToDate\">You can override the default item price for special quotes. Consider costs, market rates, and volume discounts when setting prices for different customers and quantities.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Project\">Project</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Project\">Project</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is Item Line Project To ToDate\">The project this line item relates to.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Is Item Line Profit Project Projects To ToDate\">Assign line items to projects to analyze project feasibility and profitability before work begins. This helps with project-based pricing and resource planning.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Division\">Division</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Division\">Division</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Division Is Item Line On\">The division or department responsible for this line item.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Business By Division Divisions Is On Port Quote Rate To ToDate\">Use divisions to track quote activity by business segment. This helps analyze which divisions generate the most opportunities and their conversion rates.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"TaxCode\">Tax Code</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"TaxCode\">Tax Code</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code Is Item Line Tax TaxCode To ToDate\">The tax code applied to this line item.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount And Code Custom Customer Is Item On Price Quote Rate Select Status Tax TaxAmount TaxAmounts TaxCode To ToDate Total Type\">Select the appropriate tax code based on the item type and customer tax status. This ensures the quote displays accurate tax amounts and total prices.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"TaxAmount\">Tax Amount</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"TaxAmount\">Tax Amount</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Is Item Line Tax TaxAmount\">The calculated tax amount for this line item.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Automatic Custom Customer Customers From FromDate Is On Price Quote Rate Tax TaxRate To ToDate UnitPrice\">Automatically calculated as (quantity × unit price) × tax rate. This shows customers the tax component of their quoted price separately from the base amount.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Is Item Line Tax To ToDate Total\">The total amount for this line item including tax.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Custom Customer Is Item Line Price Quote Tax TaxAmount To ToDate UnitPrice\">Calculated as (quantity × unit price) + tax amount. This is the final amount the customer would pay for this line item if they accept the quote.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "sales-quote-lines"
}
